cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use GenoPilot in your research, please cite the exact version you used.
type: software
title: GenoPilot
abstract: >-
  Guided, reproducible genome workflows for researchers without deep
  bioinformatics expertise. A terminal interface configures and runs packaged,
  pinned Snakemake workflows that remain runnable directly through Snakemake.
authors:
  - family-names: Oberwasserlechner
    given-names: Michael
version: 0.0.1
date-released: 2026-09-30
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: https://github.com/BYTEOWLS/genopilot
url: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@byteowls/genopilot
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - genomics
  - reproducibility
  - Snakemake
  - consensus genome
  - annotation transfer
  - terminal user interface
